{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8a0b42b5eb43394a66a4a4d8358f437c70546db0cc2ea53e8670b8adcb17c3c8", "ja": "（グラビア撮影の後、アイドルたちと花火をした。\n片付けも終わったし、あとは帰るだけか……）", "zh": "（写真拍摄结束后，和偶像们一起放了烟花。收拾也完成了，接下来就只要回去了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "812469458e4897a27cbec29f584a47fd09e4700a658432db52cf61820adb4bb5", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、そんなところで何してるの？\nみんな帰る準備できてるよ。", "zh": "哥哥，你在那儿做什么呢？\n大家都已经准备好回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f61cfe478bffdb1c9234555942615c798b056e2485bde8fdcacf71d130232151", "ja": "ああ、桃子。ごめんごめん。\nさっきの花火が楽しかったなと思ってね。", "zh": "啊，桃子。抱歉抱歉。\n我刚才还在想，刚才的烟花真开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "1fb56820de063a1c79a2e4c4ec0a6bffc614af7298bc77665510bc35a9f68a07", "ja": "もう、大人なんだからしっかりしてよね。\nまあ、桃子も楽しかったから、気持ちはわかるけど。", "zh": "真是的，你可是大人，振作一点啦。\n不过，桃子也觉得很开心，所以能理解你的心情就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cee486719818468e1a70920ec26e02853b462a8e5f818d2eaacf710c5e9927d0", "ja": "ははっ、ありがと。\n桃子もたくさんはしゃいでたな。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。\n桃子也玩得很尽兴呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "654a9421514dda76762e2acdeda803679dcdec534a4c9288c6d905eac9e4a7dc", "ja": "も、桃子より、茜さんの方がはしゃいでたもん。\n両手に花火持ったまま走ってて、ビックリしちゃった。", "zh": "才、才没有，茜小姐可比桃子闹腾多了。\n两只手都拿着烟花到处跑，吓了桃子一大跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "2d4f05ba2742770a209c9775bc5277f923c981717d9de47a93b960ecb3f7942c", "ja": "それにお兄ちゃんだって、「これじゃ足りないな」って\n途中で花火買い足したでしょ？", "zh": "而且哥哥你也说了“这样还不够啊”，\n中途又买了些烟花吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1007_p", "source_sha256": "13959d8a7b989e3ff7fd8d4a9a07c3081889c52de0019e57bbeb23f3848674e8", "ja": "あはは、そうだな。でもお店に花火の在庫がなくてね。\n次は、もっと用意しないとって反省したよ。", "zh": "啊哈哈，确实呢。不过店里没有烟花的库存了。\n我还在反省下次得多准备一些才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "8f6569b9b6396e9f892bdaa8212b2ef3cf626abe90acbd03d99fe601ac9c4be0", "ja": "えっ？　次……あるの？", "zh": "诶？还有下次……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1009_p", "source_sha256": "02c3c98c399dfe2f869e798f2af925a73f6103628036c7e257d3a49f334e51ee", "ja": "もちろん！　夏は長いからな。\n今日できなかったことは、次回の楽しみにしておこう。", "zh": "当然了！毕竟夏天还长着呢。\n今天没能玩成的，就留着下次再好好期待吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "9bba0189a1549c302185e978bc9701fc510cabaa94381dc2ec45b2773a6478f1", "ja": "……うん！　桃子、また劇場のみんなとやりたい！\nあと色が変わる花火もいっぱい買っておいてね♪", "zh": "……嗯！桃子还想和剧场的大家一起玩！\n还有，记得多买点会变色的烟花哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0392_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b6ff2cd76628b75b2cdbb017bc5de34217924b2057a9f63860955670186d81f5", "ja": "（帰る道中も、桃子は楽しそうに花火の話をしていた。\n次もまたその次も、何度でも桃子と花火をしよう！）", "zh": "（回去的路上，桃子还一直开心地聊着烟花。下次、下下次，无论多少次，都要和桃子一起放烟花！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
